scope: Diagnose and migrate mechanism-based client buckets into semantic UI, capability, runtime, and application-shell ownership without recreating a god-directory.
applies_to: cwd=/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/nucleus; reuse_rule=ownership principles and checks are reusable; re-inspect imports, callers, aliases, and exact validation state before another migration.

